# 基本文章編集のパネル: the desktop's own and the process put up the same panels and write the
# same record (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. Two copies of 基本文章編集 with 30 paragraphs
# (mkbig doc 30): letters picked by carrying the hand across them, then 文字サイズ > 数値指定
# (one line asked: 14 taken back, 20 typed, Enter), 書式 > 新規タブ書式... (six labelled
# boxes, Enter as they are) and 書式 > ルビ > ルビ（上） (one line asked: abc typed, Enter)
# chosen from the menu opened at 300,250, and saved. Record 0 of both must be the same, byte
# for byte; the shots of each panel up (doc_panel_k_*, doc_panel_p_*) are compared afterwards
# where the panel stands (the window's middle: 140,160 to 660,460), and the text after
# (101,125 to 682,482).
# The menu opens with the item chosen last on the pointer's row, its rows 20 apart (閉じる,
# a line, 保存, 表示, 編集, 書体, 文字修飾, 文字サイズ 140 below 閉じる, 文字色, 書式 180
# below); a menu beside it opens with its first row on the row it hangs from (数値指定 320
# below, 新規タブ書式... on it, ルビ 100 below and ルビ（上） on that). The desktop's first menu
# has nothing chosen before it; the process's first one has 書式, chosen last by the
# desktop's. While the desktop's menu or panel is up the desktop answers no sync.
# Keys: Backspace 2A, Enter 28; Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
mkbig doc 30
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
drag 160 170 420 170
sync 600
click 300 250 1
wait 400
move 330 390
wait 300
move 440 390
wait 400
move 440 710
wait 300
click 440 710
wait 1000
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_panel_k_size
key 2A
key 2A
text 20
wait 300
key 28
wait 500
sync 600
click 300 250 1
wait 400
move 330 290
wait 300
move 440 290
wait 400
move 440 290
wait 300
click 440 290
wait 1000
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_panel_k_tab
key 28
wait 500
sync 600
click 300 250 1
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 350
wait 400
move 560 350
wait 400
click 560 350
wait 1000
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_panel_k_ruby
text abc
wait 300
key 28
wait 500
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_panel_k_done
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
